Package: proot-distro
Version: 4.18.0-1+ocean3
Architecture: all
Maintainer: OceanStudio <maintainer@ocean.studio>
Depends: bash, jq, proot, tar, coreutils, zstd, xz-utils, gzip, bzip2, curl, ca-certificates
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://ocean.studio
Description: Independent PRoot guest manager implemented for OceanStudio
 Installs, logs into, backs up and restores guests using its own registry,
 download cache and var/lib/proot-distro/installed-rootfs state. Does not invoke
 or install the ocean-distro command. Existing guests are preserved on upgrade.
